  "title": "Simple Delicious Salad",
  "description": "This simple green salad features crisp lettuce tossed with fresh crumbled bacon, diced hard boiled eggs, shredded carrot and sliced tomato, drizzled with oil and vinegar.",
  "authors": [
    "Samantha"
  ],
